  "3057": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "Ako bázu podpriestoru z 1) si môžeme zvoliť $((-1, 0, 1)^T, (1, 1, 0)^T)$. Nech $B = ((1, 1, 1)^T, (-1, 0, 1)^T, (1, 1, 0)^T)$ je báza $\\mathbb{R}^3$. Potom platí:\n$$\n[f_A]^B_B = \n\\left(\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\n3 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 0 & 2\n\\end{array}\n\\right)\n$$\nTeda na to aby som našiel $A$ mi stačí nájsť $[id]^K_B$ a $[id]^B_K$ a potom $A = [id]^B_K[f_A]^B_B[id]^K_B$. Máme:\n$$\n[id]^B_K = ([e_1]_B \\ | \\ [e_2]_B \\ | \\ [e_3]_B) = \n\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & -1 & 1 \\\\\n-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n-1 & 2 & -1\n\\end{array}\\right) \\\\\n[id]^B_K = ([b_1]_K \\ | \\ [b_2]_K \\ | \\ [b_3]_K) = \n\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & -1 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right)\n$$\nTakže:\n$$\nA = \\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & -1 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 1 & 0\n\\end{array}\\right)\n\\left(\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\n3 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 2 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 0 & 2\n\\end{array}\n\\right)\n\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & -1 & 1 \\\\\n-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n-1 & 2 & -1\n\\end{array}\\right)\n=\n\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n3 & -1 & 1 \\\\\n1 & 1 & 1 \\\\\n1 & -1 & 3\n\\end{array}\\right)\n$$"
      }
    ]
  },
